{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124470","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012447001:1":{"text":"휴 놀래라... 오늘이 내 제삿날이 되는 줄 알고, 장례식에서 모두에게 <잠자는 토끼 가족>을 불러달라고 해야겠다는 생각까지 했다니까.","source_cn":"吓死我了……差点以为今天将成为我的忌日，我都想好葬礼上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C5B21F98B38987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012447002:1":{"text":"누나, 기억 나? 어릴 때, 누나가 그 노래 자주 불러줬잖아.","source_cn":"莱卡，你记得吗？小时候你总唱这首歌给我听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B24155FF818353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012447003:1":{"text":"그런 말 하지 마! 네가 죽었다면, 브라이언에게 네 유골을 세상의 끝으로 날려보내라고 했을 거야!","source_cn":"少说这些！你今天要是死了，我会让布莱恩把你的骨灰吹到世...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07844A8706F35C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012447004:1":{"text":"너무해... 난 그냥 농담한 건데.","source_cn":"你也太过分了……我只是开个玩笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6473E49D11E6B202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012447005:1":{"text":"제 생각에도 좀 지나친 것 같군요.","source_cn":"我也觉得太过分了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F65D111B9DA500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen